{
  "name": "HL·00 Errors",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL·00 Errors (lesson 6.4, layer 1)\nOne alert channel for every platform.\n- **Error Trigger**: set this workflow as Settings → Error workflow on EVERY n8n workflow (HL·01–HL·12).\n- **Webhook /hl-errors**: Make (error-handler route) and Zapier (final webhook step or error notification) POST {workflow, step, message, url, order_id} with header x-hl-secret.\nAlert: workflow, node, order_id, execution link. Logged to events.\n\n**Credentials:** Telegram, Postgres (Supabase).\n**Environment:** HL_EDGE_SECRET (same value in Make and Zapier), N8N_BLOCK_ENV_ACCESS_IN_NODE=false.\n**Replace:** YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "f7d3119e-a6c1-43e4-97ca-aabc1ccd59c0",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -528,
        -251
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "76bd2bb2-13c8-4fb8-a677-43be9a90bd03",
      "name": "Error Trigger",
